    "gp_section_601614466408580018": {
      "type": "gp-section-601614466408580018",
      "settings": {
        "section_preload": "true",
        "checksum": "044bd2f30c45efbd4d5df57f73203c6a32a75b22997956cb750d145b0073ae63_1_1_1_0__1",
        "ggS6jQYCKit_text": "<strong>If cleaning your cat's teeth always ends with scratches and bites,&nbsp;</strong><br><strong>this </strong><span style=\"color:#47B5E9;\"><strong>gentle method makes dental care</strong><i><strong> finally feel safe</strong></i></span>",
        "ggzB8PcR17b_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/4833/3323/files/gempages_577888762156024773-2f099bba-862b-4314-aae4-31a23fe77405.png",
        "ggzB8PcR17b_srcSet_tablet_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/4833/3323/files/gempages_577888762156024773-4338bf83-526f-4093-9367-5ab506e78c03.png",
        "ggzB8PcR17b_srcSet_mobile_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/4833/3323/files/5_reasons_why_page_6.jpg",
        "gggEL49kpJV_text": "<p>No fights. No forcing. No triggering their Jacobson's organ.<br>Just direct plaque removal — where brushing actually fails.</p>",
        "ggtvH9ItTg7_label": "<p>Why dental care matters</p>",
        "ggPYCUWnOtl_text": "<p>Trusted by<strong> 35.000+ Cat Owners&nbsp;</strong></p>",
        "ggQeL12Xxp__srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/4833/3323/files/5_reasons_why_page_27.jpg",
        "ggQeL12Xxp__srcSet_tablet_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/4833/3323/files/gempages_577888762156024773-4338bf83-526f-4093-9367-5ab506e78c03.png"
      }
    },
    "gp_section_601614466408645554": {
      "type": "gp-section-601614466408645554",
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "eb8aa2628e5a1858a9817bdcfeab62c7be94fc71c6b26e8dbb9e43ea59f0d677_1_1_1_0__1",
        "ggPTQ4b2Oyp_text": "<strong>Plaque today. </strong><span style=\"color:#D30E0E;\"><i><strong>Gingivitis tomorrow.</strong></i></span>",
        "ggUD4YdXUjF_text": "<p>Plaque and bacteria build up every single day.</p><p>Left untreated, it leads to feline gingivitis — red, swollen gums,&nbsp;<br>tooth loss, and vet bills reaching <strong>$2,500 or more.</strong></p>",
        "gg7zWXq-7qs_text": "<p><i><strong>80% of cats show signs of dental disease by age 3.</strong></i></p>"
      }
    },
    "gp_section_601614466408711090": {
      "type": "gp-section-601614466408711090",
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "6987a53807455dee94d27cfce312414883be86a9fbb788e7b596865231dca1fa_1_1_1_0__1",
        "ggEV9Gqw5F4_text": "<strong>Why does cat dental care&nbsp;</strong><br><span style=\"color:#BA352E;\"><i><strong>feel impossible?</strong></i></span>",
        "ggomPVTK3lK_text": "<p>Most solutions fall into two categories:</p><p>Passive methods (powders, water additives) that are easy to use —<br>but take weeks to show any results, and can't remove existing plaque.</p><p>Active methods (silvervine sticks) that cats love —<br>but you can't control where they chew, and most ignore their back molars.</p><p>The problem? Plaque builds fastest on back molars.<br>If you can't target those teeth, you're not preventing gingivitis.</p>",
        "ggk4i0A7S2y_text": "<p><i><strong>\"If you can’t see it working — it probably isn’t.\"</strong></i></p>",
        "ggmJ_kIYslM_text": "<span style=\"color:#47B5E9;\"><i>FreshWipes</i></span> &nbsp;vs. \"the other internet solutions\"",
        "ggevVTCj_Gj_text": "<p>FreshWipes</p>",
        "gg-MIMvGcVj_text": "<p><strong>Silvervine Sticks</strong></p>",
        "ggXs__ln_ev_text": "<p>Dental powders &nbsp;&amp; Water additives</p>",
        "ggfUoSanMRY_text": "<p>Removes existing plaque buildup</p>",
        "gg-IuBpUpXd_text": "<p>You control which teeth get cleaned</p>",
        "gge1LmTfUed_text": "<p>You can see it working (proof)</p>",
        "ggFt6X66C2l_text": "<p>Cat actually tolerates it</p>",
        "gg0E19wDNgd_text": "<p>(Can cause vomiting)</p>",
        "ggLraSd0Cf4_text": "<p>No risk of reduced water intake</p>",
        "ggSzxjN6mr-_text": "<p>Cats may drink less (kidney risk)</p>",
        "gg7S-Ps0dUW_text": "<p>How it makes you feel as a dog owner:</p>",
        "ggA5sYFFmhT_text": "<p>😊😌 ✅</p>",
        "ggnxoRgwUs6_text": "<p>😖😩</p>",
        "ggC4NtyLJqF_text": "<p>😕🤷‍♀️</p>"
      }
    },
